msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，主要用于提供高效的核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力，支持Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法的同时，针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, primarily designed to provide efficient kernel auto-tuning, operator compilation, and deployment capabilities. It supports Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950 series products and is compatible with Triton core syntax while undergoing deep optimization for Ascend NPU features, including automatic parsing of kernel function parameters, optimization of memory access logic, and enhancement of secure deployment mechanisms."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

msgid "Ascend产品：支持Atlas A2/A3/950系列。"
msgstr "Ascend products: support Atlas A2/A3/950 series."

msgid "NPU配置：建议至少单卡32GB内存。"
msgstr "NPU configuration: It is recommended to have at least 32GB of memory per card."

msgid "操作系统：需Linux系统，具体请参考<a href=\"https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #0066cc;\">兼容性查询助手</a>。本文接下来所有操作均以**Ubuntu**环境演示。"
msgstr "Operating System: Linux is required. For details, please refer to the <a href=\"https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #0066cc;\">Compatibility Query Assistant</a>. All subsequent operations in this document are demonstrated in a **Ubuntu** environment."

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #0066cc;\">"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #0066cc;\">"

msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。其中，可以参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》 完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine the CANN, Python, and TorchNPU software versions and install them. For reference, you can follow the \"[CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)\" guide on the Ascend community official website to complete the driver and firmware installation."

msgid "CANN版本：9.1.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.1.0"

msgid "Python版本：python3.11"
msgstr "Python version: python3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.7.1.post8"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.7.1.post8"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more compatibility details, please refer to the [Version Release Notes](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Installation"

msgid "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\\n"
msgstr "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"

msgid "源码安装"
msgstr "Source code installation"

msgid "安装依赖"
msgstr "Install dependencies"

msgid "apt update\\n"
msgstr "apt update"

msgid "编译Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Compile Triton-Ascend"

msgid "git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git && cd triton-ascend\\n"
msgstr "git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git && cd triton-ascend"

msgid "自定义LLVM构建（可选）"
msgstr "Custom LLVM Build (Optional)"

msgid "如果需要自定义构建LLVM过程的，可以执行下面的步骤去编译Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr "If you need to customize the LLVM build process, you can follow the steps below to compile Triton-Ascend."

msgid "**代码准备**：通过`git checkout`检出指定版本的LLVM源码并应用补丁。"
msgstr "**Code Preparation**: Check out the specified version of the LLVM source code via `git checkout` and apply the patch."

msgid "git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git\\n"
msgstr "git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git"

msgid "**构建LLVM**：路径 `/path/llvm-install` 为用户规划的LLVM安装路径，需根据实际调整；路径`{PATH_TO}`为用户第一步检出LLVM源码的路径。"
msgstr "**Building LLVM**: The path `/path/llvm-install` is the user-planned LLVM installation path, which should be adjusted according to the actual situation; the path `{PATH_TO}` is the path where the user checked out the LLVM source code in the first step."

msgid "export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install\\n"
msgstr "export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install"

msgid "**编译Triton-Ascend**"
msgstr "**Compile Triton-Ascend**"

